Also named: <i>Kain</i> (Κάϊν "Cain" G2535)
§ Cain = "possession"
eldest son of Adam and Eve and the first murderer having murdered his brother

H1893:
A man living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Gen.4.2; 
son of: Adam (H0121) and Eve (H2332); 
brother of: Cain (H7014B) and Seth (H8352)
Also named: <i>Abel</i> (Ἄβελ "Abel" G0006) 
§ Abel = "breath"
second son of Adam and Eve, killed by his brother Cain

H5897:
A man living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Gen.4.18; 
